``code`` and ``message`` in the class body and no ``__init__`` —
``ItemNotFoundException`` in :mod:`src.core.exceptions.not_found` is the
shape. Leave ``field`` unset on invalid credentials: naming the input
that was wrong tells an attacker which half of the pair to keep.
"""

